		(property "Description" "LED display / interface circuit: 18-bit serial word (DATA, CLB, DLEN) into a 17-bit shift register, two 16-bit latches (bit 17 selects latch A or B), multiplexed to 16 open-collector outputs; DUP selects static or duplex output, LOEX loads the latches directly. Q8 and Q16 take 80 mA, the others 40 mA. VCC 4-6 V. Pins Q1-Q16 = 14 17 21 24 23 20 16 13 18 22 2 10 12 11 3 1, DUP 7, LOEX 4, DATA 8, DLEN 5, CLB 9, VCC 6, VEE 15 and 19. On N34 (BCD output) as D3400/D3401"
